d483f51c-1a54-47ef-9f4a-0454c6254e32	management evolve over time from elicitation to change management.\n6.6.2.2 Configuration management\n6.6.2.2.1 General\nThe purpose of Configuration Management is to manage and control system elements and configurations\nover the life cycle. Configuration Management also manages consistency between a product and its\nassociated configuration definition.	iso_29148.pdf	\N	601	[-0.05180234,-0.028344313,0.060023345,0.026020277,-0.0036954687,0.02193947,-0.01539334,0.054467544,-0.014793529,0.032014426,0.05398184,0.008478866,0.036430076,0.030263705,-0.023170438,-0.00794014,0.023740469,0.122189865,0.028476533,-0.018074192,0.033357274,-0.011623955,-0.0044317376,0.040540587,0.053707216,0.07048645,-0.0091451,-0.05244567,0.009952914,-0.04287176,0.0062761665,0.0075474377,0.04306036,0.07221036,-0.05571763,0.015071319,0.024617668,-0.005285806,-0.06901186,0.0127242915,0.029758614,0.027543431,-0.012731213,0.008776591,0.02787879,-0.040791802,-0.016262826,-0.03584364,0.009200984,-0.023512477,0.015988663,0.04769665,-0.011617007,0.010985045,-0.037665583,0.0007764521,-0.024612617,-0.0063308375,-0.019846462,-0.026219793,-0.033535767,0.025765218,0.013390326,0.015657945,0.046344,-0.02249354,0.05989414,0.035645943,-0.013639215,0.13257666,0.032857362,0.0018170323,-0.035195965,0.012767999,0.120527506,0.035013665,-0.040425837,0.031536523,0.008282848,-0.026616998,-0.039379492,0.04235863,-0.05521613,0.0013090901,0.08230843,-0.008411109,-0.09031114,-0.013159049,0.06523046,-0.04413409,0.07051361,-0.011961653,-0.032345697,0.0046862033,0.023196716,-0.048639096,0.01531665,0.019892078,-0.029676998,0.022153826,0.034659527,-0.03639574,-0.007384125,-0.012679195,-0.003975185,-0.05240926,-0.04787295,-0.03429665,0.04619199,0.060604442,-0.050487626,0.0120416535,-0.030178715,-0.051163603,-0.0009561597,-0.031006297,-0.0002710073,0.02934311,0.046430945,-0.01703165,0.008199269,-0.030425917,-0.017946197,-0.0042472775,0.01712242,-0.03100096,-0.03094217,0.019956524,-0.0027053128