d3b96fea-37db-4e50-b9b1-6da3affa5220	with many aspects of managing software projects. FSM methods are organized into two parts: uses\nfor project management and uses for forecasting and performance management. If FSM methods are\nto provide high-fidelity results, it is very important to achieve an accurate and complete allocation and\nderivation of a system's software requirements from the system requirements.	iso_29148.pdf	\N	632	[-0.02597602,-0.006812117,0.032687724,0.022240637,-0.005373386,0.030724926,-0.052543875,0.001998775,0.041146953,6.3195395e-05,0.05665008,0.00028568073,-0.05112278,-0.032440167,-0.016815977,-0.0043823966,0.048854783,0.10682874,-0.00090435304,0.027307704,0.024845883,-0.030812783,0.05904372,0.030716654,0.037856724,0.05081951,0.00736485,-0.051294316,-0.0056477785,0.023607818,0.033992853,-0.0357731,0.023739213,0.032854382,-0.11194385,-0.04735067,0.034836493,-0.053488627,-0.011316924,0.045166664,-0.008566405,0.07609512,-0.0013843749,0.029731052,-0.013451853,0.024100535,-0.033916473,-0.008340889,-0.034657933,-0.064074434,-0.048115835,0.08754124,0.027919652,0.025336318,0.06871428,-0.0061223516,-0.09247913,-0.026674101,-0.026242463,-0.011953843,-0.048416622,0.012918217,0.0034842663,0.008044776,-0.0048155687,0.029349443,0.013111314,-0.0010512588,0.022314712,0.078344874,0.039699033,0.025731824,-0.042554077,0.011973904,0.123837516,0.08487984,-0.02621864,0.0386605,-0.019693518,0.021374857,3.6047782e-05,0.056937728,-0.014313187,-0.015399891,0.12359403,0.020304577,-0.07369923,-0.025553882,0.07501877,-0.04572787,-0.015529023,-0.0066836667,-0.050841507,0.0023684048,-0.0017106,-0.03855965,-0.03637857,-0.06785893,-0.04067904,-0.0152676,0.021971187,0.015467271,0.04786434,0.026901934,-0.026727594,-0.086511865,0.03565109,0.006240608,-0.014538829,0.05308283,-0.015825374,0.0071783336,-0.07130235,-0.056889486,0.012287549,-0.037615877,-0.02902084,0.015676556,0.010828069,0.0038277374,0.022731489,-0.018580597,-0.003361979,-0.024038179,0.032379244,0.051054012,0.055096